      "tool": "mcp__wzrdmail__update_draft",
      "preview": "Hello, I stayed at [HOTEL NAME] in Phoenix from [CHECK-IN] to [CHECK-OUT], reservation #[CONF#]. While reviewing my card statement I found the same charge posted twice: • Charge 1: $[AMOUNT] on [DATE 1] • Charge 2: $[AMOUNT] on [DATE 2] (identical amount, same folio) This appears to be a duplicate authorization/posting error rather than two separate stays or services. Please review the folio and reverse the duplicate charge. Once reversed, the credit typically appears on my statement within 5-10 business days — I'd appreciate written confirmation of the reversal, plus a copy of the final folio"
    },
